# Personal Claude Code / Codex / Cursor / Grok wiring for this checkout.
# Repo-scoped `ln -s ../../claude/...`, `ln -s ../../codex/...`,
# Cursor-only `ln -s ../../claude/...` into `.cursor/skills/`, and
# Grok-only `ln -s ../../claude/...` into `.grok/skills/` are the
# canonical install (see docs/MIGRATION.md §1.2 / cursor/AGENTS-snippet.md /
# grok/AGENTS-snippet.md); the agent home carries only the global-only
# utilities. Never commit per-machine state.
# One link under `.claude/skills/` points into tracked `.flaitron/` instead of
# `claude/`: flaitron-self's `/audit` overlay body is versioned at
# `.flaitron/audit-overlay/`, so it survives this rule rather than excepting it
# (SPEC/layout.md, CONTRIBUTING.md). The link itself stays ignored.
.claude/
.agents/
.cursor/
.grok/
